  "scene_style": {
    "id": "gouache-childhood-v1",
    "description": "Detailed hand-painted gouache and coloured-pencil storybook environments, warm paper light, sea-green foliage, weathered timber and soft ink detail. Side-on or shallow stage view with quiet walking space and horizontal ground near the lower edge. Fictional schematic memory places. Backgrounds contain no people, animals, text, logos or interface; use only source-supported details."
  },
